F user code for Joint center location markers and skeleton connection hierarchy. SurfaceAndSiteDefinitions - DEF user code for the various Shape nodes for surface geometry and Site location markers and Site connections. Basic Default I pose All Joints = 0 0 1 0 Pose T | Pose A |Modify this set to experiment Pose H | Pitch1 Animation_loa4 Example x-axis rotations Pitch2 Animation_loa4 Example x-axis rotations Yaw1 Animation_loa4 Example y-axis rotations Yaw2 Animation_loa4 Example y-axis rotations Roll1 Animation_loa4 Example z-axis rotations Roll2 Animation_loa4 Example z-axis rotations Walk Animation_loa4 Example Walk animation Run Animation_loa4 Example Run animnation Jump Animation_loa4 Example Jump animation Kick1 Animation_loa4 Example Kick animation Kick2 Animation_loa4 Example Kick animation STOP Stop Animation - choose another Animation to start TimerControls Selection of timer for animation }
